<Placemark><name>Core by Clare Smyth ★4.8</name><description>Clare Smyth's three-Michelin-star flagship (Three Stars retained in the 2026 MICHELIN Guide) — British produce-led fine dining at its absolute peak.

💷 Tasting menus: Core Seasons £275, Core Classics £265; à la carte lunch £205 / dinner £235 (lobster &amp; spelt +£20); wine pairing £175
🕐 Lunch Thu–Sat 12:00–14:15; dinner Tue–Sat 18:30–21:45; closed Sun–Mon (re-verified on official site Aug 2026)
🚇 Elizabeth line Custom House→Bond Street (~20 min) + Central line 3 stops to Notting Hill Gate + 8-min walk; ~45 min door-to-door
📍 92 Kensington Park Road, London W11 2PN

