<Placemark><name>Ikoyi ★4.4</name><description>Two Michelin stars (2026 guide) — Jeremy Chan's singular West-African-spiced, hyper-seasonal tasting menu at 180 Strand; nothing else in the world cooks like it.

💷 Tasting menu £395; shorter tasting £180 (the sane entry point)
