https://ikoyilondon.com</description><Point><coordinates>-0.1149,51.5125,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Galvin La Chapelle ★4.6</name><description>One Michelin star (2026 guide) — French-Mediterranean cooking in a spectacular vaulted Victorian chapel, 4 minutes' walk from Liverpool Street; the shortest ride home of any starred pick.

💷 Set lunch £49 (2 courses) / £55 (3); 8-course tasting £155 (pairings £80/£130); à la carte mains £34–50; Sunday lunch £49/£55
