<Placemark><name>Brat ★4.5</name><description>One Michelin star (2026 guide) — Tomos Parry's Basque-style wood-fire cooking above a Shoreditch shopfront; the rare starred room that's open every day and walk-in friendly.

💷 À la carte only, realistic £70–100pp; signature whole turbot for two at market price (historically ~£120–140); small plates £6–30
